<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/optical-sensors">Optical &amp; Sensors</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">MEMS &amp; Optical Sensor Packages</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Optical &amp; Sensors products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/optical-sensors/camera-modules"><span class="abbr">CM</span><span class="label">Camera Modules &amp; Sensors</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/optical-sensors/mems-sensors"><span class="abbr">MS</span><span class="label">MEMS &amp; Optical Sensor Packages</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the module has to see or display and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Optical &amp; Sensors &middot; MEMS &amp; Optical Sensor Packages</div><h1 class="mk-h1">MEMS &amp; Optical Sensor Packages</h1><p class="mk-lede">MEMS and optical sensor performance can be affected by mechanical stress, package geometry and contamination introduced during assembly. Hana uses low-stress die attach, controlled cure profiles and cleanroom manufacturing to protect sensitive die throughout packaging.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-mems-sensors" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="~/images/photos/mk-optical-sensors-card-camera-modules.webp" alt="Optical sensor die mounted on a board under an open holder" style="height:420px;object-fit:cover;" /></div></div></section><section id="specialize-mems-sensors" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">Hana assembles MEMS and optical sensor devices on cleanroom lines under controlled ESD conditions, using low-stress die attach and cavity, clear or capped package formats selected for the device. This capability forms part of Hana's wider OSAT, IC assembly and optical manufacturing operations.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Optical sensor packages</span></div><div class="desc">Proximity, ambient-light, color and time-of-flight sensor devices assembled and packaged as finished components.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">MEMS die assembly</span></div><div class="desc">MEMS die attach, interconnect and packaging using processes selected to minimise mechanical loading of the sensing structure.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Cavity and clear packages</span></div><div class="desc">Clear transfer mold, metal or plastic caps and film-assist mold formats selected according to device requirements.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">04</span><span class="t">Cleanroom build and test coverage</span></div><div class="desc">Assembly under cleanroom and controlled ESD conditions, with electrical and functional test available according to program requirements.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">See MEMS &amp; Sensor Assembly for the wafer-level handling, probe and packaging processes supporting these devices.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/microelectronic-assembly/mems-sensor-assembly">Explore MEMS &amp; Sensor Assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:820px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Low-stress die attach and package control</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:0 0 14px;">MEMS sensor performance depends on controlling mechanical stress through die attach and package assembly while maintaining a clean environment around the exposed die. Hana selects attach materials and cure profiles according to the device requirements and uses cavity or clear package formats where the sensing structure or optical path must remain unobstructed. Assembly is performed on cleanroom lines under controlled ESD handling through to sealed package.</p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><div class="note">MEMS and optical sensor assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ohio"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">USA</span></span><div class="nm">Ohio</div><div class="note">optical and precision assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">board-level support</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What MEMS device types can Hana assemble?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana assembles MEMS die and optical sensor devices, including proximity, ambient light, color and time-of-flight sensors, through to finished packaged components. The applicable device and package formats are confirmed per program and site.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Why does packaging stress matter for a MEMS sensor?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">A MEMS sensing structure can be affected by mechanical loading introduced through die attach or package assembly. Hana uses low-stress attach materials, controlled cure profiles and cavity packaging where required to minimise this loading.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana test and calibrate sensors during production?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Electrical and functional test can be integrated into the manufacturing process, with the applicable test and calibration requirements defined per program.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/optical-sensors" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Optical &amp; Sensors market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your MEMS or optical sensor program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>